    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வைத்தியன்",
    "text": "Tell the Maharani to dance...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d040",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u045",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "விக",
    "text": "Yes, O king! Look, there is no one else... so let her dance!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d041",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u046",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Hmm... dance! In our country everyone is equal... everyone may dance... women who do not know how to dance are not women at all! Isn't that right, Vikata?",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d042",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The comic pseudo-egalitarian proclamation is preserved as printed."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u047",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "விக",
    "text": "The way women walk these days is itself like a dance, isn't it!",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d043",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u048",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "[Purushothaman enters.]",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": null,
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": {
      "kind": "entrance-action",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "description": "Purushothaman enters during the mock durbar."
     },
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u049",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Oh-ho! A king from the neighbouring country?... Have you come happily? Have you come angrily?...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d044",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u050",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "புருஷோத்",
    "text": "Enough, man... keep quiet...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d045",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u051",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Oh! He has come angrily... Hey!... brainless king!... foolish ruler!... where have you come? State the business that brought you... why have you come to Vasanthan's durbar?... Minister!... Is that enough anger!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d046",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "Vasanthan follows Vikatan's instruction literally and insults the real king; the comic escalation is retained."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u052",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அரசர்",
    "text": "Hey, Vikata, what performance is this!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d047",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u053",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "விக",
    "text": "A coronation rehearsal... Amma asked us to show it!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d048",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u054",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "அர",
    "text": "Physician! What medicine are you giving him—are you curing his madness or not!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d049",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u055",
    "kind": "dialogue",
    "speakerLabel": "வச",
    "text": "Madness?... who said that? This is an incurable disease!...",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/dialogues/records/scene-038.json",
     "canonicalScenePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
     "sourceRecordId": "manohara-s038-d050",
     "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
     "sourceLocator": null,
     "pageProvenance": [
      {
       "pdf_page": 61,
       "printed_page": 60
      }
     ]
    },
    "translation": {
     "mode": "prose-faithful",
     "notes": [
      "The joke explicitly loops back to scene 28's diagnosis."
     ]
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "manohara-en-s038-u056",
    "kind": "stage-direction",
    "speakerLabel": null,
    "text": "[The mock durbar breaks off.]",
    "source": {
     "sourcePath": "works/manohara/scenes/scene-038.md",
